#: ../../source/docs/rangefinder-autolanding.rst:5
#: f964d0dd3ed744c0b683b9cdb3ec8554
msgid "Using a Rangefinder for Autolanding"
msgstr "使用测距仪进行自动降落"

#: ../../source/docs/rangefinder-autolanding.rst:7
#: c277a0a0cca144e3bec77fe384765e41
msgid ""
"If you have :ref:`fitted a rangefinder <common-rangefinder-landingpage>` to "
"your aircraft then you can use it for much more accurate landing control. To"
" allow the rangefinder to be used for landing you need to set the "
":ref:`RNGFND_LANDING <RNGFND_LANDING>` parameter to 1. The first rangefinder"
" with :ref:`RNGFND_LND_ORNT<RNGFND_LND_ORNT>` orientation found, will be "
"used. Normally, this will be \"down\" (25) for most planes, but Tailsitter "
"Quadplanes would normally use \"back\" (4) so that the rangefinder is "
"pointing at the ground during a tailsitter landing with its nose vertical."
msgstr ""
"若您的飞机 :ref:`安装了测距仪 <common-rangefinder-"
"landingpage>`，则可以使用它实现更精确的降落控制。要允许测距仪用于降落，需要将 :ref:`RNGFND_LANDING "
"<RNGFND_LANDING>` 参数设为 1。系统将使用第一个具有 :ref:`RNGFND_LND_ORNT<RNGFND_LND_ORNT>` "
"方向的测距仪。通常对大多数飞机而言方向为「朝下」（25），但尾坐 QuadPlane 通常使用「朝后」（4），使测距仪在尾坐降落时（机头垂直）指向地面。"

#: ../../source/docs/rangefinder-autolanding.rst:13
#: f8dcb8f0611e4b9cbb1809dd8000fafa
msgid ""
"When using a rangefinder for landing the altitude given by the rangefinder "
"is used only in the landing approach and to determine the flare point, and "
"is designed to allow the aircraft to more accurately follow the glide slope "
"and to flare at the right time."
msgstr "使用测距仪进行降落时，测距仪给出的高度仅在降落进近和判断拉平点时使用，旨在让飞机更精确地跟随下滑坡面并在正确时机拉平。"

#: ../../source/docs/rangefinder-autolanding.rst:20
#: 6915c0ae341d476ca78d8a287f596067
msgid ""
"The effectiveness of a rangefinder can depend on the surface you are flying "
"over, so it is a good idea to do some low passes in a flight mode such as "
"FBWA first, then examine the logs to check that the rangefinder is working "
"correctly."
msgstr "测距仪的效果可能因飞行地面情况而异，因此建议先在 FBWA 等飞行模式下做几次低空通场，然后查看日志确认测距仪工作正常。"

#: ../../source/docs/rangefinder-autolanding.rst:25
#: ac277888a1b94d6bb3339e9834bb6032
msgid ""
"Also note that if you have a longer range rangefinder then it is a very good"
" idea to set the minimum range of the rangerfinder well above zero. For "
"example, the PulsedLight Lidar has a typical range of over 40 meters, and "
"when it gets false readings it tends to read ranges of less than 1 meter. "
"And setting :ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` to 1.5 , if its the first "
"system rangefinder, will discard any rangefinder readings below 1.5 meters, "
"and will greatly improve the robustness of the Lidar for landing."
msgstr ""
"另外请注意，若您的测距仪量程较大，强烈建议将测距仪的最小量程设置为远高于零的值。例如，PulsedLight 激光雷达的典型量程超过 40 "
"米，出现错误读数时往往读到不足 1 米的距离。将 :ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` 设为 "
"1.5（若其为第一个系统测距仪），将丢弃所有低于 1.5 米的测距仪读数，大大提高激光雷达降落的可靠性。"

#: ../../source/docs/rangefinder-autolanding.rst:32
#: 4641ee36815b4f40a86578533d95f15a
msgid ""
"If the autopilot has a good rangefinder (:ref:`such as LIDAR <common-"
"rangefinder-lidarlite>`) then you can safely choose quite small numbers for "
":ref:`LAND_FLARE_SEC<LAND_FLARE_SEC>` and "
":ref:`LAND_FLARE_ALT<LAND_FLARE_ALT>`, and flare closer to the ground than "
"with the default values. That will generally produce a better landing."
msgstr ""
"若飞控配备了良好的测距仪（:ref:`如激光雷达 <common-rangefinder-lidarlite>`），则可以放心地将 "
":ref:`LAND_FLARE_SEC<LAND_FLARE_SEC>` 和 "
":ref:`LAND_FLARE_ALT<LAND_FLARE_ALT>` 设为较小值，使飞机比默认值更贴近地面进行拉平，通常能带来更好的降落效果。"

#: ../../source/docs/rangefinder-autolanding.rst:35
#: 6b41e9e50abc4b9c9afd278ba22957a2
msgid ""
"A value for :ref:`LAND_FLARE_SEC<LAND_FLARE_SEC>` of 1.5 and "
":ref:`LAND_FLARE_ALT<LAND_FLARE_ALT>` of 2 is a good place to start with a "
"LiDAR."
msgstr ""
"使用激光雷达时，:ref:`LAND_FLARE_SEC<LAND_FLARE_SEC>` 设为 "
"1.5，:ref:`LAND_FLARE_ALT<LAND_FLARE_ALT>` 设为 2 是一个不错的起始值。"

#: ../../source/docs/rangefinder-autolanding.rst:38
#: bd04fd073d4d47fb8acb3ceaf9d3b30a
msgid "Impact of Glide Slope Terrain variation"
msgstr "下滑坡地形变化的影响"

#: ../../source/docs/rangefinder-autolanding.rst:40
#: 0604d037a3fc4411b4008382fb395a61
msgid ""
"If using rangefinder during landing, the rangefinder readings, once engaged "
"(ie when getting good readings below the :ref:`RNGFND1_MAX<RNGFND1_MAX>` "
"altitude on approach), will continuosly adjust the glide slope target "
"altitudes as it approaches. If the terrain is irregular, or there is a deep "
"ditch before the runway threshold, using the rangefinder can actually be "
"worse than just using the barometeric altitude."
msgstr ""
"在降落期间使用测距仪时，测距仪读数一旦介入（即在进近时获得 :ref:`RNGFND1_MAX<RNGFND1_MAX>` "
"高度以下的有效读数），将持续调整下滑坡目标高度。若地形不平整或跑道入口前有深沟，使用测距仪的效果实际上可能比仅使用气压高度计更差。"

#: ../../source/docs/rangefinder-autolanding.rst:42
#: ed39d2d7f6fd4d95b23d7ac7310c6474
msgid ""
"In these cases, you may wish to lower the :ref:`RNGFND1_MAX<RNGFND1_MAX>` "
"altitude to a value closer to the expected vehicle altitude at the end of "
"the runway so that it engages and is used shortly before the flare."
msgstr ""
"在这些情况下，您可能希望将 :ref:`RNGFND1_MAX<RNGFND1_MAX>` "
"高度降低至接近跑道末端预期飞机高度的值，使其在拉平前不久才介入。"

#: ../../source/docs/rangefinder-autolanding.rst:44
#: 4a9b2c1d31c94868b32d7a2045eaec74
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if the terrain is sloping toward or away from the runway, you"
" may use the :ref:`TERRAIN_FOLLOW<TERRAIN_FOLLOW>` parameter (bit 1(all "
"modes) or 3(AUTO mode only) set to provide additional corrections to the "
"rangefinder readings for the difference between landing point terrain "
"altitude and current approach altitude above terrain to help prevent landing"
" overshoots and undershoots. Be sure to carefully test for your particular "
"situation and be ready to abort the autolanding if it does not look safe."
msgstr ""
"或者，若地形向跑道倾斜或远离跑道，可使用 :ref:`TERRAIN_FOLLOW<TERRAIN_FOLLOW>` 参数（位 1（所有模式）或位 "
"3（仅 AUTO "
"模式）），为测距仪读数提供额外修正，补偿降落点地形高度与当前进近时地面以上高度之间的差异，有助于防止降落过冲或欠冲。请务必针对您的具体情况仔细测试，并在自动降落看起来不安全时做好中止准备。"
